000051F6                          1302  ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
000051F6                          1303  DMMNEXTO
000051F6                          1304  ; SEARCHES THE NEXT MEMORY SLOT WITH THE SPECIFIED ID AND OUTPUTS A POINTER
000051F6                          1305  ; TO THE CORRESPONDING DATA (SLOT ADDRESS+2)
000051F6                          1306  ; INPUT    - D0.W : ID TO SEARCH
