00005226                          1338  ; FREES THE SLOT TO WHICH THE PROVIDED POINTER BELONGS BY SETTING ITS OWNED TO
00005226                          1339  ; SYSTEM (0)
00005226                          1340  ; INPUT    - A0   : POINTER BELONGING TO THE SLOT TO FREE
